member.summary:
The template to use for the selected item

            Default value:


            SelectedItemTemplate = item => (Window, item);

Optional factory called every time this menu is about to open (just before
             fires).
            When set,  is called automatically before the factory runs,
            so the item list is always freshly built.
            Items created by the factory subscribe to  during construction
            and therefore receive it for the same open cycle — so 
            is evaluated correctly on first open.

This is the recommended approach for dynamic menus whose items change
            between invocations — it replaces the fragile pattern of subscribing to
             and calling Clear()+AddButton() inside the handler.

Example:

            menu.ItemsFactory = m =>
            {
                m.AddButton("Close",  _ => Close());
                m.AddButton("Reload", _ => Reload());
            };

